### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/api/models/test

### 仅内置结构校验（不依赖规则库）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/models/validate/builtin
Content-Type: application/json

< sample/sample-parsed-model.json

### 完整校验：内置结构校验 + 规则库中已启用规则
POST http://localhost:8080/api/models/validate
Content-Type: application/json

< sample/sample-parsed-model.json

### 分页查询规则列表（keyword / targetType / severity / enabled 可筛选）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rules?page=0&size=20

### 规则可选值：严重程度 / 已用检测对象
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rules/severities
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rules/target-types

### 新增规则示例：Block 必须有文档注释
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ruleCode": "GEN-003",
  "ruleName": "Block必须有注释",
  "scope": "模型",
  "targetType": "Block",
  "condition": "documentation不能为空",
  "severity": "WARNING",
  "message": "Block元素建议补充文档注释",
  "fixSuggestion": "为Block元素添加注释",
  "ruleVersion": "1.0",
  "script": "function main(element) {\n  if (element.documentation == null || element.documentation === \"\") {\n    return false;\n  }\n  return true;\n}"
}

### 启用/停用规则（enabled=true 启用，false 停用）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rules/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": false
}

### 更新 / 删除规则
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rules/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ruleCode": "GEN-003",
  "ruleName": "Block必须有注释（改）",
  "scope": "模型",
  "targetType": "Block",
  "condition": "documentation不能为空",
  "severity": "WARNING",
  "message": "Block元素建议补充文档注释",
  "fixSuggestion": "为Block元素添加注释",
  "ruleVersion": "1.0",
  "script": "function main(element) {\n  if (element.documentation == null || element.documentation === \"\") {\n    return false;\n  }\n  return true;\n}"
}

DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rules/1

### 幂等初始化 40 条种子规则（仅补充缺失编号，不覆盖修改）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rules/init

### 校验任务：创建 / 列表 / 详情 / 重跑 / 删除 / 报告
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskName": "联调冒烟任务",
  "modelName": "sample-parsed-model",
  "modelJson": "{}",
  "builtinOnly": false
}

GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?page=0&size=10
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/rerun
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1

### 导出报告：format=html（默认）/ docx(word) / json / csv
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/report?format=html
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/report?format=docx
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/report?format=json